# CatDex — Project Context

## Product

**CatDex** — « Ton quartier. Tes chats. »

Street-cat collector: photograph a cat → AI analysis → add to personal CatDex album + map pin. Core fantasy = Pokémon-like discovery in a real neighborhood (MVP focus: Paris).

## Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| App | Expo **54**, React Native `0.81`, React `19`, TypeScript, **expo-router ~6** |
| UI | `src/theme/` + `@/components` (not Tailwind in RN) |
| State | Zustand + AsyncStorage persist (`src/store/`) |
| Backend data | Supabase (auth, Postgres/PostGIS, Storage) |
| Analyze API | Hono server in `server/` (OpenAI Vision) |
| Map | `react-native-maps` + MapLibre (web) |

## Source layout

```
app/                 # expo-router screens
src/components/      # UI + feature folders (Auth, maps, missions, reward, scanner, motion…)
src/theme/           # design tokens + ThemeProvider
src/store/           # zustand
src/lib/             # api, supabase, progression, errors, sync…
src/types/           # Cat, CatAnalysis…
server/              # Vision API (port 8787)
supabase/            # schema.sql + migrations
docs/                # product / deploy / vision docs
```

Path alias: `@/*` → `./src/*`.

## Language

- **UI copy: French**
- Code identifiers: English preferred; comments may be FR/EN

## Non-goals / do not

- Do **not** treat `ChatDex Mobile App UI/` as RN source of truth (Figma/web export only)
- Do **not** invent hex/spacing/type outside `src/theme/` (coat/rarity → `src/lib/catTheme.ts` only)
- Do **not** hardcode secrets; use env vars (`EXPO_PUBLIC_*` client, server `.env`)
- Do **not** skip Expo v54 docs: https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v54.0.0/

## Companion rules

Start with `01-product-design`, `02-design-system`, `04-game-design`, then stack/domain files as needed.
